            Node("transfer_scale_le", "transfer scale le", "For the specified parameters, the following hypotheses imply the stated relation: (next : ι → Bool → ι) (allow : ι → Bool → Prop) (x y a : ℝ) (h6 : a*x^6 ≤ y^6) (h20 : a*x^20 ≤ y^20) : ∀ i j, (a • transfer next allow x) i j ≤ transfer next allow y i j", DescribeRole.Theorem, AssessedProvenance.FromRepo()),
